<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><meta name="robots" content="noindex"><title>ページが見つかりません | DATLUME</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f6f9;color:#142033;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Noto Sans JP",sans-serif;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh}.box{width:min(560px,calc(100% - 32px));background:#fff;border:1px solid #e4e9f0;border-radius:18px;padding:34px}.code{font-size:12px;color:#1769e0;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}h1{font-size:30px;margin:8px 0 12px}p{color:#667085;line-height:1.7}a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:10px;background:#1769e0;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 15px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}</style><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand/footer.css?v=20261010-2"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand/navigation.css?v=20261011-2"><script src="/brand/navigation.js?v=20261011-2" defer></script><style>body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}header{background:#0e1b2e;padding:14px 0}.wrap{width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto}.box{box-sizing:border-box;margin:48px auto;flex:1}header a{margin-top:0}</style></head><body><header><div class="wrap"><SiteNavigation /></div></header><main class="box"><div class="code">404</div><h1>ページが見つかりません</h1><p>URLが変更されたか、ページが存在しない可能性があります。</p><a href="/">トップへ戻る</a></main><SiteFooter /></body></html>
